## Health plans
| Plan | Provider | Monthly price per employee, PLN | Company pays, PLN | Employee pays, PLN | Family add-on per person, PLN | Includes |
| Basic Care | Norda Med Sp. z o.o. | 96 | 96 | 0 | 74 | GP and specialist outpatient visits, lab tests, 1 dental check per year |
| Plus | Norda Med Sp. z o.o. | 141 | 96 | 45 | 118 | Basic Care + basic dental, 6 physiotherapy sessions per year |
| Premium | Norda Med Sp. z o.o. | 228 | 96 | 132 | 209 | Plus + private hospital stays, full dental, 12 physiotherapy sessions per year |
| Cold Shield (add-on) | Norda Med Sp. z o.o. | 38 | 38 | 0 | not available | audiometry and respiratory check every 12 months; mandatory offer for staff with 20% or more of shifts in cold stores |
| | | | | | | |
| Waiting period | 3 months after start date for Plus and Premium; Basic Care and Cold Shield from day 1 | | | | | |
| Switching plan | once a year, window 1-15 November, change effective 1 January | | | | | |
| Contact | benefits desk, Weronika Szczepańska-Bohm (People Partner), ext. 4132 | | | | | |
## Pension contributions
| Tenure band | Company contribution, % of gross pay | Employee contribution, % of gross pay | Company money vests |
| Under 1 year | 1.5 | 2.0 | after 24 months in the plan |
| 1 year to under 3 years | 2.5 | 2.0 | after 24 months in the plan |
| 3 years to under 6 years | 3.5 | 2.5 | immediately |
| 6 years and more | 4.5 | 3.0 | immediately |
| | | | |
| Rule | Value | | |
| Automatic enrolment | after 3 months of service; opt-out within 30 days of enrolment | | |
| Contribution base cap | PLN 18,000 gross per month; pay above that is not matched | | |
| Provider | Pekao-Nord Employee Capital Fund (PNECF) | | |
| Payroll cut-off for changes | 20th of the month | | |
## Perks
| Perk | Who is eligible | Value | How often | How to get it | Comment |
| Sports card | all employees after probation | company pays PLN 90 of the PLN 150 monthly price | monthly | automatic via payroll | the family card is 100% on the employee |
| Public transport | Tricity-based employees | up to PLN 180 per month towards a monthly SKM ticket | monthly | receipt on the People Desk by the 5th | not combinable with the Rotterdam mobility budget (obviously) |
| Night-shift shuttle | night shift at GDY-1 | free | every night shift | no claim needed | outbound 21:10 from Gdynia Chylonia station, return 06:15 from the gatehouse; the driver does not wait |
| Night meal voucher | night shift | PLN 22 | per night shift | automatic | paid in the app, not cash |
| Thermal clothing allowance | staff in cold stores | PLN 950 | per calendar year | receipts by 30 November | base layers and socks; the jacket is issued separately |
| Birthday voucher | all employees | PLN 150 | yearly | automatic in birthday month | |
| Tenure award 5 years | all employees | PLN 1,500 plus 1 extra day of leave | once | automatic | the old PLN 800 voucher is gone |
| Tenure award 10 years | all employees | PLN 3,800 plus 3 extra days of leave | once | automatic | |
| Tenure award 15 years | all employees | PLN 6,000 plus 5 extra days of leave | once | automatic | ask Ines about the dinner, there is a dinner |
| Referral bonus, operations | any employee except the hiring manager | PLN 2,700 | per hire, paid after the new hire completes 6 months | form on the People Desk | |
| Referral bonus, tech roles | any employee except the hiring manager | PLN 4,600 | per hire, paid after the new hire completes 6 months | form on the People Desk | tech = IT, Tidewalk dev and KC-Hub firmware |
| Language course subsidy | all employees | 70% of the fee, max PLN 1,600 | per calendar year | invoice to People & Culture | same rule as Handbook 11.4 |
| Christmas package | all employees | voucher worth PLN 400 | yearly | handed out at the December all-hands | |
| Welcome-baby payment | employees with 12 months of service | PLN 1,350 gross per child | per child | birth certificate to People & Culture | see Handbook 10.2 |
| Glasses for screen work | office staff | up to PLN 250 | every 24 months | eye-test invoice | |
